## ⚔️ Gameplay Example
- **Setup:** capital ship will patrol a location and be ambushed by the opposing team
- **Flow:** capital ship is to be neutralized and boarded and secured , distortion guns are required and planning is a must 
- **End Condition:** capital ship is secured and all enemies cleared 

